      },
      "message": "feat(finish3d): gap_link - a straight link across gap openings\n\nAdd the gap_link parameter to the finish3d parameters: Jump (default,\nthe retract/clearance hop, byte-for-byte unchanged) and Straight (one\nstraight Feed link between the run ends at their own tip height). The\nStraight link is certified by the exact segment-triangle sweep of the\nmove at the budget r - TOUCH_EPS: grazing rims pass, a real bite\nrefuses, and a refusal takes the Jump hop. The raster serpentine runs\na broken back line whole (pieces reversed too), so gap links cross\ntheir gap instead of the field. Project words jump/straight, no\nversion step-up; digest tag 0x4D only for a non-Jump choice.\n\nPinned by crates/motion/tests/finish3d_gaplink.rs (6 pins), the\nproject_roundtrip gap-link pins and the mcp params-door pin.\n\nFixes #1708",
