      "message": "Merge main into issue/1708-straight-gap-link\n\nResolved the single conflict in crates/app/src/operation/params.rs\n(the Adaptive2D trochoidal digest stamp) by taking main's superset\nform: the 0xA5 method marker followed by the 0xA6 trochoidal-parameter\nblock (max_engagement, ret, return_feed, loop_width). This keeps both\nsides' digest additions in digest-format-valid order before the arm\ncloses.\n\nBecause main delegates Finish3D to stamp_mill3d, the branch's gap_link\n0x4D digest was carried into mill3d.rs's Finish3D arm, and the gap_link\nfield was added to the Finish3D test initializer in setup_align_3d.rs.\n\nTargeted gate results:\n- cargo check -p camcraft-app: clean\n- cargo check -p camcraft-app --tests: clean\n- cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings: clean\n- cargo test -p camcraft-app --test adaptive_trochoid: 12/12 pass\n- cargo xtask gate quick: timed out after 15 min building test binaries;\n  no failure attributed to this change",
      "tree": {
